# Prelude to Puissance (jeuno 170), the level either side of 90 and of 75 (> 90 / >= 75 / below) and the Limit Breaker:
# Warriors at cap 95, Dormant Powers Dislodged completed (level 91 with the key is the main flow's). Level 74 (main):
# 10045 (74, 1, 0, 0); 75 (c75): 10045 (75, 1, 4, 2); 90 (c90): 10045 (90, 1, 4, 2); level 91 without the Limit Breaker
# (nokey): 10045 (91, 2, 0, 0). Each 10045 finished with option 13: no 10045 handler in the available section, nothing
# (not begun, not completed).
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=74
char c75 zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=75
char c90 zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=90
char nokey zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=91
keyitem LimitBreaker
levelcap 95
quest Jeuno.DormantPowersDislodged completed
c75: keyitem LimitBreaker
c75: levelcap 95
c75: quest Jeuno.DormantPowersDislodged completed
c90: keyitem LimitBreaker
c90: levelcap 95
c90: quest Jeuno.DormantPowersDislodged completed
nokey: levelcap 95
nokey: quest Jeuno.DormantPowersDislodged completed
login
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # level 74: 10045 (74, 1, 0, 0)
finish option=13                        # nothing
c75: login
c75: trigger Nomad_Moogle               # level 75: 10045 (75, 1, 4, 2)
c75: finish option=13                   # nothing
c90: login
c90: trigger Nomad_Moogle               # level 90: 10045 (90, 1, 4, 2)
c90: finish option=13                   # nothing
nokey: login
nokey: trigger Nomad_Moogle             # no Limit Breaker: 10045 (91, 2, 0, 0)
nokey: finish option=13                 # nothing
